"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>Α \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Ἰησοῦς Χριστὸς θεοῦ\n                    υἱὸς Σωτὴρ καὶ\n                    σταυρωθείς\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰησοῦς\">Ἰησοῦς\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Χριστὸς\">Χριστὸς\u003C/span> θεοῦ \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>υἱὸς \u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"epithet\" data-text=\"Σωτὴρ\">Σωτὴρ\u003C/span> καὶ \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"epithet\" data-text=\"σταυρωθείς\">σταυρωθε[ίς]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span> Ω \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>Α\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Ἰησοῦς Χριστὸς θεοῦ\n                    υἱὸς Σωτὴρ καὶ\n                    σταυρωθείς\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰησοῦς\">ΙΗΣΟΥΣ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Χριστὸς\">ΧΡΙΣΤΟΣ\u003C/span>ΘΕΟΥ\u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>ΥΙΟΣ\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"epithet\" data-text=\"Σωτὴρ\">ΣΩΤΗΡ\u003C/span>ΚΑΙ\u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"epithet\" data-text=\"σταυρωθείς\">ΣΤΑΥΡΩΘΕ[..]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al5-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>Ω\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>\u003Cspan>Text after Filippi and SEG, following Filippi's transcription of the manuscript tradition\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2> translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>In contrast to the other texts reported in the 18th-century Trapani manuscript tradition, this text is quite possibly not a forgery; it is however most likely to be post-antique, as suggested by Korhonen (di epoca postmedievale). It was omitted by Kaibel, presumably on these grounds.\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> 2002 52.0900 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Filippi 2002 74-75 no. 6/8 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001991\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001991\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Filippi 2005 70 no. 6/8 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002296\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10002296\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> Korhonen 2017 199 n. 15 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001484\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001484\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\"> Line 1    Interlineation line 1 to 2    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. \u003C/div>",[218,221,224,227,230,233],{"id":219,"html":220},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>Α \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Ἰησοῦς Χριστὸς θεοῦ\n                    υἱὸς Σωτὴρ καὶ\n                    σταυρωθείς\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἰησοῦς\">Ἰησοῦς\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Χριστὸς\">Χριστὸς\u003C/span> θεοῦ \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>υἱὸς \u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"epithet\" data-text=\"Σωτὴρ\">Σωτὴρ\u003C/span> καὶ \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"epithet\" data-text=\"σταυρωθείς\">σταυρωθε[ίς]\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span> Ω \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Jonathan Prag\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>Α\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"divine\" data-text=\"Ἰησοῦς Χριστὸς θεοῦ\n                    υἱὸς Σωτὴρ καὶ\n                    σταυρωθείς\">\u00